  "title": "Pork Chop Soup",
  "description": "This easy pork soup starts with slow-simmered pork chops that are shredded and cooked with a hearty mixture of potatoes and other vegetables.",
  "authors": [
    "Oisín Ó Searcóid"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-03T23:48:32-04:00",
